  "handle": "marou-dark-chocolate-65-drops-500g",
  "body_html": "<p><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">Marou</span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\"> Dark Chocolate 65% Drops from </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">Vietnam is the perfect ingredient for pastry </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">chefs, bakeries, chocolatiers, and chocolate </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">snackers</span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\"> alike! Made at origin from the finest </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">cacao beans, this authentic dark chocolate offers </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">a fresh, well-rounded chocolate with hints of </span></span><span class=\"TextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun BCX9 SCXP201628233\">citrus and caramel.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"TextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\">Crafted for a wide range of uses, our dark </span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\">chocolate drops melt smoothly and evenly, </span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\">providing the perfect consistency to elevate </span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\" data-contrast=\"none\" data-usefontface=\"true\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP258038164 BCX9\">your favorite chocolate recipes.</span></span></p>",
